# Short verification path for the certificate QR code.
#
# The QR encodes the full URL, and at the size the code prints — 17.2mm,
# fixed by the certificate's approved layout — every character costs scan
# margin. The long form pushed the symbol to a 53x53 grid, which is 3.83
# pixels per module at 300 DPI: below the density a phone camera needs, and
# measured, one certificate in seven would not decode even from a clean
# render. /v/ drops the payload from 86 characters to 60 and the symbol to
# 45x45, which is 4.51 px per module at the same printed size.
#
# Permanent, because it is printed on documents that cannot be reissued.
/v/*   /verify-certificate/?ref=:splat   301
